            "created_at": "2026-09-28T06:27:03.499Z",
            "cooked": "<p>I build and self-host n8n workflows for small businesses, mostly order intake, notifications and AI steps that touch a real inbox or a real WhatsApp number instead of a demo.<br>\nWhat I can take on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>n8n workflows end to end: forms, webhooks, conditional routing, Google Sheets as the record, Gmail alerts, status flows, retries and error branches</li>\n<li>WhatsApp and AI agents: I run a live ordering agent that reads customer messages in Roman Urdu and English, turns them into structured orders and hands off to a human when the message is unclear</li>\n<li>API and data integration: REST APIs, webhooks with signature checks, OAuth, CRMs and spreadsheets, Python or JavaScript helpers where a node is not enough</li>\n<li>Reliability work on someone else’s broken workflows: debugging to root cause, idempotency so repeated requests cannot double-create, logs so failures are visible<br>\nProof: portfolio with live systems and repos at mahsaanullah.online<br>\nRate: USD 20-25 per hour, or a fixed price for a scoped flow. I like starting small, one flow or one fix, so you see the output before committing to anything bigger. 20+ hours per week, and I work asynchronously in PKT (UTC+5).<br>\nIf you have a workflow that keeps breaking, or one you never got around to building, send me a DM with what it should do and I will tell you honestly if I can build it and what it would take.</li>\n</ul>",
